---
description: LLM and agent conventions
globs:
  - "apps/api/**/*agent*.ts"
  - "apps/api/**/*llm*.ts"
  - "apps/worker/**/*agent*.ts"
  - "apps/worker/**/*llm*.ts"
---

- Never parse free-form model text when a structured schema can be used.
- LLM output is untrusted input.
- Validate model output before state mutation.
- Give the model only the context required for the decision.
- The model may recommend an action but may not directly perform side effects.
- Record enough metadata in `AgentRun` to reproduce and debug decisions without storing sensitive payloads unnecessarily.
